
## Main API Endpoints

All API routes are prefixed with `/api/` and accept JSON.

### Auth
- `POST /api/auth/register/`
- `POST /api/auth/login/`
- `POST /api/auth/refresh/`
- `GET /api/auth/me/` – JWT protected

### Wallet
- `GET /api/wallet/`
- `GET /api/wallet/transactions/`
- `POST /api/wallet/deposit/`
- `POST /api/wallet/withdraw/`

### Sports
- `GET /api/sports/`
- `GET /api/matches/`
- `GET /api/matches/{id}/`
- `PATCH /api/matches/{id}/update-odds/` – admin/master

### Bets
- `POST /api/bets/place/`
- `GET /api/bets/`
- `POST /api/parlays/place/`
- `GET /api/parlays/`

### Reports
- `GET /api/reports/overview/` – admin/master
- `GET /api/reports/daily/` – admin/master

### Audit
- `GET /api/admin/audit-logs/` – admin/master

### Payments
- `POST /api/payments/webhook/` – deposit confirmation webhook

## Public Web Routes

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `/` | Home page showing next matches |
| `/register/` | Create account |
| `/login/` | Session login |
| `/logout/` | Session logout |
| `/password-reset/` | Request password reset |
| `/password-reset/confirm/` | Complete password reset |
| `/matches/` | All matches |
| `/matches/{id}/` | Match detail + place a single bet |
| `/parlay/` | Build a parlay bet |
| `/parlays/` | Show parlay history |
| `/wallet/` | View wallet, pending deposits, deposit / withdraw |
| `/bets/` | Show single bet history |

## Admin Web Routes (visible only to admins & masters)

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `/dashboard/` | Overview stats |
| `/admin/reports/` | Daily reports |
| `/admin/sports/` | Create sports and tournaments |
| `/admin/matches/` | List matches |
| `/admin/matches/create/` | Create a new match |
| `/admin/matches/{id}/edit/` | Edit a match |
| `/admin/matches/{id}/settle/` | Settle a match |
| `/admin/matches/{id}/cancel/` | Cancel and refund a match |
| `/admin/users/` | List users |
| `/admin/users/{id}/edit/` | Update user role / limits / commission |
| `/admin/audit/` | View audit logs |

## Environment
Copy `backend/.env.example` to `backend/.env` for local development outside Docker.  
Docker Compose already passes suitable defaults in `docker-compose.yml`.

